{"id":"59574fe12e6b6cd2","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md","title":"标准自然数扩张满足全真理语言归纳","display":"thm-truth-induction-adequacy — 标准自然数扩张满足全真理语言归纳","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy","aliases":["91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy"],"display":"thm-truth-induction-adequacy — 标准自然数扩张满足全真理语言归纳","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-induction]]","[[91-prop-truth-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-truth-induction-adequacy — 标准自然数扩张满足全真理语言归纳"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08a0ab6453addb52\" href=\"?note=08a0ab6453addb52\" title=\"91-df-truth-induction\">91-df-truth-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"551c8bf1fc88e1ec\" href=\"?note=551c8bf1fc88e1ec\" title=\"91-prop-truth-induction-schema\">91-prop-truth-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(\\mathbb N,T^{\\mathcal M})\">\\(\\mathcal M=(\\mathbb N,T^{\\mathcal M})\\)</span> (任意真理谓词外延下的标准自然数扩张)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公式的全归纳模式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x,\\vec y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x,\\vec y)\\)</span> (归纳实例公式)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\forall T^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left[\n(\\mathbb N,T^{\\mathcal M})\n\\models\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\forall T^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left[\n(\\mathbb N,T^{\\mathcal M})\n\\models\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给定任一实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x,\\vec a)\">\\(\\varphi(x,\\vec a)\\)</span>，若它在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 成立且对标准自然数保持\n后继，那么外部的普通自然数归纳说明它对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 成立。\n这一论证与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathcal M}\">\\(T^{\\mathcal M}\\)</span> 的具体外延无关。</p>\n<p>标准模型有效性不等于某个公理理论对所有模型完备，也不保证任意非标准\nKF 固定点扩张满足全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>-归纳。原文件把模型满足、理论可证\n和正公式确定性混成双条件，三者需要分别证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-induction","status":"resolved","id":"08a0ab6453addb52","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-prop-truth-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"551c8bf1fc88e1ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-induction-schema]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M=(\\mathbb N,T^{\\mathcal M})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x,\\vec y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\forall T^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,\n\\left[\n(\\mathbb N,T^{\\mathcal M})\n\\models\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi(x,\\vec a)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathcal M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false}],"bytes":1387,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-